{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Weight Log 是一款無需註冊或登入的私人健康記錄工具，讓你在同一處追蹤體重、膳食、運動與日常習慣，適合剛開始控制飲食、建立運動習慣，或想保留個人健康日誌的使用者。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>體重飲食運動一站記錄</h2>\n<p>開啟後可在數秒內記錄體重，BMI 與趨勢圖表自動更新，並同時記下膳食卡路里、運動紀錄與習慣打卡連續天數。設定目標體重後，進度總覽以清晰圖表呈現。程式支援 15 種語言、可完全離線運作，資料只存放於裝置本機，需要時可隨時匯出備份。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-745-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-746-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-747-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-748-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1242x2688bb-749-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Weight Log Diet Calorie Track</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-29T14:38:13.661000+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":302,"images":5,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}